{"seq":15,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/claude-code-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/sy-02-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T08:18:40.657Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"a8c18e1cc8db0c8ae5001310d4466b1617dc8ec5f69baecd8fa135df65935295","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"Hi Tobias, here are the Marrow Fieldworks tickets I found:\n\n*From Moss's notes* (\"Moss: Central handoffs next week\", teams/team-central/digests, 2 Jan 2026):\n• *#4409*: recurring timeout on the Gatehouse Check-In report at the Salina North yard (Bay 4 and the west grain-bin apron, during the 06:00 flatbed intake)\n• *#4412*: driver SMS prompt glitch when staging combine trailers on unpaved overflow lots\nThese were flagged by Hollis as open on the dealer account before the 5 Jan 2026 handoff.\n\n*From #central-random* (13 Oct 2026, 09:27, your own message):\n• *#8841*: West yard Door 2 at the Plains depots still double-booking when flatbeds check in early at the kiosk. You flagged it after Hollis asked about the tractor-bay alerts on your dealer account.\n\nOne caveat: neither source names the account directly next to the ticket numbers. Moss lists \"Marrow Fieldworks\" as the account changing hands and then calls it \"Pree's dealer account\", and #central-random calls it \"your dealer account\". I've read both as Marrow Fieldworks, but it's worth a quick check.\n\nI left out two that belong to *Marrow Agrisupply*, a different account: FR-882 (feature request, in the same Moss note) and PD-4821 (in #central-team). Moss's Central cheat sheet has no Fieldworks tickets. I didn't find any other ticket numbers for this account."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
{"seq":16,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/claude-code-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/sy-02-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T08:18:46.473Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"2d17c92dcc458ead22003b6fa4ceeb7813155695dba5c613edf7a2f23445d652","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"I sent Tobias a reply in his DM. I found three ticket numbers, but neither source puts the name \"Marrow Fieldworks\" right next to them, so I told him to check that before his customer call.\n\n- **#4409**, from Moss's \"Central handoffs next week\" note (2 Jan 2026): the Gatehouse Check-In report keeps timing out at the Salina North yard.\n- **#4412**, from the same Moss note: an SMS prompt glitch for drivers staging combine trailers.\n- **#8841**, from #central-random (13 Oct 2026, Tobias's own message): West yard Door 2 is double-booking flatbeds that check in early.\n\nMoss's note names Marrow Fieldworks as the account changing hands on 5 Jan, then lists the two tickets under \"Pree's dealer account\". In #central-random, Hollis calls it \"Tobias's dealer account\". I read both as Marrow Fieldworks.\n\nI left out FR-882 and PD-4821 because they belong to Marrow Agrisupply, a different account, and told Tobias why. Moss's Central cheat sheet has no tickets for this account.\n\nI only used sources Tobias can see himself: #central-random, which he's a member of, and Moss's public notes. I didn't use `search_messages`."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1791987000.000125"}}
